  "description": "A modern UptimeRobot.com API client for .NET with full API coverage, pagination support, and nullable reference types. Supports .NET 9.0, .NET 8.0, .NET 6.0, and .NET Standard 2.0. This is a RELEASE CANDIDATE with breaking changes from v1.x - test before upgrading production systems.",
