  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0-rc.3 - RELEASE CANDIDATE 3 - Please test before production use\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t⚠️ BREAKING CHANGES - This is a pre-release version with major changes from v1.x\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tWhat's Fixed in RC.3:\n\t\t\t- Fixed critical enum serialization bug where MonitorType and other enums were sent as strings instead of numbers\n\t\t\t- Fixed maintenance windows deserialization error when requesting monitor details with Mwindows parameter\n\t\t\t- Monitor.Mwindows property changed from List<string> to object to handle polymorphic API responses\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tWhat was Fixed in RC.2:\n\t\t\t- Fixed JSON deserialization error with nullable enums and empty string values from API\n\t\t\t- Added NullableEnumConverter to gracefully handle unexpected enum values\n\t\t\t- Improved API resilience and error handling\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tMajor Features from RC.1:\n\t\t\t- Modernized API surface with PascalCase property names\n\t\t\t- Enabled nullable reference types throughout\n\t\t\t- Added strongly-typed enum parameters (no more magic numbers)\n\t\t\t- Implemented Alert Contacts, Maintenance Windows, and Status Pages APIs\n\t\t\t- Added automatic pagination support with IAsyncEnumerable\n\t\t\t- Added cancellation token support to all async methods\n\t\t\t- Improved exception handling with custom exception types\n\t\t\t- Added .NET 9.0 support\n\t\t\t- Added comprehensive XML documentation\n\t\t\t- Performance optimizations\n\n\t\t\tMigration Guide: See CHANGELOG.md for detailed migration instructions\n\n\t\t\tPlease report any issues on GitHub before the final 2.0.0 release.",
